Temporary generated PDFs do not require persistent storage.

CSV uploads also do not necessarily require permanent storage.

Do not provision Azure Files unless an actual filesystem requirement is found.

If permanent PDF, CSV, export, or document retention is added, use Azure Blob Storage.

Suggested Blob container:

portfolio-documents

