Azure CLI installed locally (v2.89.0) via winget. No Azure subscription created yet — this is the next step and requires the user to complete signup in the portal (portal.azure.com, Subscriptions, Add) since it involves payment and identity details. Once a subscription exists, resume at POC-A: az login, verify the subscription, then create Lucido-Apps-RG.
